  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: aircompressor 0.21.0.rhlw-00007",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released io.airlift:aircompressor 0.21.0.rhlw-00007 with backported fixes for CVE-2024-36114 and CVE-2025-67721.\n\nCVE-2024-36114: Decompressors can crash the JVM and leak memory content in Aircompressor\n\nCVE-2025-67721: Aircompressor's Snappy and LZ4 Java-based decompressor implementation can leak information from reused output buffer\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for io.airlift:aircompressor 0.21.0 from Maven Central.",
